  "document": {
    "abstract": "The SMPTE ST 2094 suite of documents defines metadata for use in color volume transforms of content. SMPTE ST 2094-2 specifies Key-Length-Value (KLV) representations of metadata sets defined in SMPTE ST 2094-10, SMPTE ST 2094-20, SMPTE ST 2094-30, and SMPTE ST 2094-40. — SMPTE ST 2094-2 specifies frame-based mapping of KLV-encoded SMPTE ST 2094 metadata sets into the MXF generic container. SMPTE ST 2094-2 specifies the key and value fields of the essence elements, the essence container label and the essence descriptor.",
